OL,3,GNEWSAThousands to get GCSE results amid
OL,4,Amajor changes in schools
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of pupils will receive their
OL,7,FGCSEs results on Thursday amid major
OL,8,Fchanges to qualifications in Wales.
OL,10,FYear 10 pupils get marks for revamped
OL,11,FGCSEs for the first time - a year into
OL,12,Fcourses which have been criticised for
OL,13,Fplacing "extreme pressure" on staff and
OL,14,Fpupils.
OL,16,FWales' main exam board, the WJEC, said
OL,17,Fit had already made changes and was
OL,18,Fdoing "everything that we can" to
OL,19,Fensure results were "fair and balanced
OL,20,Ffor all learners".
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
