OL,3,GNEWSAThousands to get GCSE results amid
OL,4,Amajor changes in schools
OL,5,
OL,6,FPupils will also get results of
OL,7,Fvocational qualifications and the Welsh
OL,8,FBaccalaureate will be awarded for the
OL,9,Flast time at this level before being
OL,10,Freplaced with new skills courses.
